# Code owners for stuie.
#
# These owners are automatically requested for review when someone opens
# a pull request that modifies matching files. The last matching pattern
# in the file wins, so put more specific patterns below the generic ones.
#
# See: https://docs.github.com/en/repositories/managing-your-repositorys-settings-and-features/customizing-your-repository/about-code-owners

# Default owner for everything.
*                          @thmswt

# Anything that affects release, CI, security posture, or governance
# wants an explicit nudge to the maintainer even if the diff is tiny.
/.github/                  @thmswt
/CODEOWNERS                @thmswt
/CONTRIBUTING.md           @thmswt
/CODE_OF_CONDUCT.md        @thmswt
/SECURITY.md               @thmswt
/LICENSE                   @thmswt
/Cargo.toml                @thmswt
/Cargo.lock                @thmswt
